ter the stacktrace and any following code has executed.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nIt shows the stacktrace but does nothing afterwards.\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Create an empty quarkus command mode project with the following code:\r\nJavaMain:\r\n```\r\n@QuarkusMain\r\npublic class JavaMain\r\n{\r\n  public static void main(String... args) {\r\n    Quarkus.run(Testing.class, args);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nTesting.java:\r\n```\r\npublic class Testing implements QuarkusApplication\r\n{\r\n  @Override\r\n  public int run(final String... args) {\r\n    boolean willFail = args[0].equals(\"foo\");\r\n\r\n    return 0;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n2. Run either in Intellij or command line. Behavior was observed to be the same in Intellij and dockerized native image.\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\nNo additional configuration is needed.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n<img width=\"1571\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2020-05-07 at 11 17 48 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6563769/81319157-e1502500-9054-11ea-894b-c6c61b7f2150.png\">\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: \r\n**Darwin MacBook-Pro.local 19.4.0 Darwin Kernel Version 19.4.0: Wed Mar  4 22:28:40 PST 2020; root:xnu-6153.101.6~15/RELEASE_X86_64 x86_64**\r\n - Output of `java -version`: \r\n**openjdk version \"11.0.3\" 2019-04-16\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment AdoptOpenJDK (build 11.0.3+7)\r\nOpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM AdoptOpenJDK (build 11.0.3+7, mixed mode)**\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n**Used the default Quarkus native build plugins**\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: \r\n**1.4.1.Final**\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): \r\n**Tested with mvnw and mvn, both 3.6.3**\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n(Add any other context about the problem here.)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"stuartwdouglas","id":328571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODU3MQ==","avatar_url":"https